      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `5face5f4e9c04ab4af0105873414778fd01919c12ab8e847f6fd194b9cea23b6--FederationLGA.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: BOCSAR — Crime statistics by LGA (NSW Bureau of Crime Statistics and Research)\n- Release or year: Current file checked 2026-11-01\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 7 of 7\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Summary of offences\" | 135f48bb586d0da571f38dbd484b07836ce81671717026f9f1a9339f78508a14 | missing |\n| \"Premises Type\" | 0ad548a5813a1e76df5b58ec37651ad1a28a558f8bf802ea67a98d4db1b62841 | missing |\n| \"Victims\" | 31cff919cc489eea3ff26d5519822ec1e51c5283cefeaab3431dd10f898b2b93 | missing |\n| \"Offenders\" | 6bacb29e5396fdbeabb05c0d0e7b4fea08887d6f6c6abf2875e0bf2e0cf9926c | missing |\n| \"Alcohol Related\" | c9e845b25bb317d65eb3dcd696551a21c48b2c647d2ea06f93edd5ad5b787bb8 | missing |\n| \"Month\" | d52ce5e0689cb92ac637b8ac2b282e178487dca06274726b4920024187b1933c | missing |\n| \"Time\" | 5d299fa93d519bc5629a0bccd7995f32ccc2f2fbf48f1eb22169442d33a6ef91 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
